04:38:17.359 --> 04:38:20.230
in order to isolate the problem down to

04:38:20.240 --> 04:38:22.869
just the handling of momentum. We're

04:38:22.879 --> 04:38:25.269
going to apply fixes here. We're going

04:38:25.279 --> 04:38:27.510
to port those fixes up to Muan. We're

04:38:27.520 --> 04:38:28.949
going to make sure that we can basically

04:38:28.959 --> 04:38:31.990
run an unlimited number of optim steps

04:38:32.000 --> 04:38:35.269
and uh never collapse our policy under

04:38:35.279 --> 04:38:38.230
TRPO. Then keeping the same momentum

04:38:38.240 --> 04:38:40.470
changes, we're going to go back to PO

04:38:40.480 --> 04:38:42.789
and get it to be stable there. And then

04:38:42.799 --> 04:38:44.709
we're going to ship a brand new fancy

04:38:44.719 --> 04:38:47.670
optim algorithm that solves all of the

04:38:47.680 --> 04:38:49.670
problems and is no longer janky

04:38:49.680 --> 04:38:51.990
hellscape RL that we've been dealing

04:38:52.000 --> 04:38:54.709
with for the past decade.

04:38:54.719 --> 04:38:58.230
That is the plan. However, uh that plan

